0131m \u00fccreti i\u00e7in internet \u00fczerinden ba\u015fvuru yap\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra i.kuleli@gmail.com adresine mail atarak belirtiniz.\r\nKat\u0131l\u0131mc\u0131 limiti dolmadan \u00f6nce \u00f6demeyi yapman\u0131z gerekmektedir.\r\n\u0130nternet \u00fczerinden \u00f6denecek \u00fccret 50 TL'dir.\r\nGerekli bilgiler mailde verilecektir.\r\n21 Ekim'e kadar iptal durumunda kat\u0131l\u0131m \u00fccreti iadesi yap\u0131lacakt\u0131r, sonras\u0131nda \u00fccret iadesi yoktur.\r\n\r\nOnline \u00f6deme yapanlar yar\u0131\u015fma listesinde \u00f6nceliklidir.\r\nYar\u0131\u015fma g\u00fcn\u00fc kay\u0131t masas\u0131nda \u00fccret \u00f6deyecekler, kat\u0131l\u0131mc\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 dolmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 takdirde giri\u015fte 70 TL \u00f6deyeceklerdir.\r\n\r\n\r\n[EN]\r\nPlease enter your name and surname during registration as it is writter on your ID.\r\nThe First letters are capital letters.\r\nDont forget to have an ID card with you when you come to the competition.\r\n\r\nPlease send an e-mail to i.kuleli@gmail.com for the registration fee on the internet, after registered on WCA.\r\nPay as soon as possible after you register, otherwise the limit can be reached and you will not be able to compete.\r\nThe fee to be paid over the internet is 50 TL.\r\nThe necessary information will be given in the mail.\r\nIn case of cancellation up to October 21st, registration fees will be refunded. After 21st the fee will not be refunded.\r\n\r\nOnline payers have priority in the competition list.\r\nUnless the competitor limit reached, those who pay the registration fee on the day of the competition will pay 70 TL.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"GEMSModernAcademyOpen2018","name":"GEMS Modern Academy Open 2018","city":"Dubai","country":"AE","date":{"from":"2018-10-27","till":"2018-10-27","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Aysha Jamsheer","email":"ajamsheer@worldcubeassoc